### ==========================================
### 5: PESQUISA E CONSULTAS
### ==========================================

### 5.1 GET Listar as configurações do produto (200 OK - devolve 2: tamanhos A e B)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{stockId}}/size-configurations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

?? status == 200

### 5.2 GET Listar as do componente sem stock (200 OK - devolve 1, com stockUnitsConsumed: null)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{freeId}}/size-configurations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

?? status == 200

### 5.3 GET Por tamanho (200 OK - preço 1.5 e 2 unidades)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{stockId}}/size-configurations/{{sizeAId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

?? status == 200

### 5.4 GET Tamanho sem configuração neste produto (404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{stockId}}/size-configurations/{{sizeCId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

?? status == 404

### 5.5 GET Produto com formato de ID inválido (400 Bad Request)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/id_invalido/size-configurations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

?? status == 400

### 5.6 GET Tamanho com formato de ID inválido (400 Bad Request)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{stockId}}/size-configurations/id_invalido
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

?? status == 400

### 5.7 GET Produto inexistente (404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/000000000000000000000000/size-configurations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

?? status == 404

### 5.8 GET Listar sem token (401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{stockId}}/size-configurations

?? status == 401

### 5.9 GET Por tamanho sem token (401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{stockId}}/size-configurations/{{sizeAId}}

?? status == 401

### ==========================================
### 6: ATUALIZAÇÃO E VALIDAÇÕES DO PUT
### ==========================================

# O PUT substitui o preço e o stockUnitsConsumed. O tamanho não pode ser alterado (remove-se e cria-se de novo).

### 6.1 PUT Válido - Mudar preço e unidades de stock (200 OK - preço 1.8 e 4 unidades)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/{{stockId}}/size-configurations/{{sizeAId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 1.8,
  "stockUnitsConsumed": 4
}

?? status == 200

### 6.2 GET Confirmar a alteração (200 OK - preço 1.8 e 4 unidades)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{stockId}}/size-configurations/{{sizeAId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

?? status == 200

### 6.3 PUT Componente sem stock - só o preço (200 OK - stockUnitsConsumed: null)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/{{freeId}}/size-configurations/{{sizeBId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 0.75
}

?? status == 200

